'''Magistrate Hurdam Toughhand''' is a [[Wildhammer dwarf]] quest giver located in the town of [[Dun Kithas]] in the [[Grim Reaches]]. [[Lord Nazgrim Redbrand]] of the [[Redbrand Estate]] owed Hurdam a favor, but it is unknown what for.<ref>{{questlong|Alliance|32|Ore Must Flow (2)|Ore Must Flow}}</ref>

